# A branch that has never been pushed. `git rev-parse @{u}` FAILS here, and this
# is the commonest state in which a body is first written, so the verdict has to
# be neither an error nor a silent pass. Nothing can be compared and nothing is
# at risk: the push creates the upstream, and the body reaches the pull request
# with `--body-file` at creation time, which is after it.
#
# <upstream-sha or -> <behind> <ahead> <wanted rc> <what the assertion says>
- 0 0 3 a branch with no upstream reports that it cannot compare
